    "text": "10 hours ago The Olean City School District held a public hearing Tuesday on the proposed $58.9 million budget for 2026-27. District business manager Jenny Bilotta told the group of about 25 people attending the annual meeting on the proposed budget it is $943,759, or 1.63% more than the current budget, but the tax levy remains unchanged at $14,026,979. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
